    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oralolakhwo ing'ombe yomwana weenywe kata likondilie nibikorile, mana niwibisa shinga ouraluutsi ta; okhukalusia obikalusie ewomwana weenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omwana weenywe naba narali ahambi ninawe ta, kata noba nomukorwa, kho oshileere hango wuwo, obe ninashio okhuula olwa omwana weenywe ashienya, mana oshimukalusilie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata isishiliye, oshikhole orio; kata inguboye ochikhole orio, kata buli shindu shiosi shiomwana weenywe, eshiba nishimukorilekhwo nawe noshinyoolile, oshikhole orio; ne oreebisakhwo shinga ourabiluutsi ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oralolakhwo isishili yomwana weeny ve kata ing'ombeye nibikwile khunjila, mana niwibisa shinga ouraluutsi ta; okhukhoonya omukhoonye okhubibuusia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi areefwala eshili shieshisaatsa, kata omusaatsa okhwifwala ingubo yeshikhasi ta; okhuba omundu yesi oukhola amakhuwa kano neshisinyo khuMWAMI Nyasayewo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noba niwitsukhana nonyoola eshitsu shielinyonyi liosi, kata mumusaala kata hasi, nishili nebisosole kata amabuuyu, nalio linyina nilikonela ebisosole kata amabuyu tsana, orabukula nyina halala nebisosole ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuula olwa olekha linyina litsie, ne ebisosole obibukule; mbu okaasenje, khandi mbu tsindaalotsio tsimeeteshe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa oba niwumbakha inzu imbia, okhole omushingachi khundulo weshilama, mbu oleshe okhuleerela inzuyo eshiina shiamabanga, omundu naba nakwileyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oraraaka mumukundakwo kwemitsabibu imwo yetsimbia tsibili ta; ebiamo biosi bileshe okhwahulilwa Nyasaye, mbu imwo yene eya waraaka halala namameeto komukundakwo kwemitsabibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oralimila ing'ombe neisishili mwikokolo elala ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oreefwala ingubo inzokatsokane, eyilushilwa obwoya bwelikondi halala neikitani ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhole amayebeyo khumikhanda chine chieinguboyo ifuubila eya wifwimbanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amalako khukobushisila bwomweha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi naba naleera omukhasi, namuteeshia, mana namukiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namuchiikha amakhuwa ketsisoni, namuleerela eliira libii, nasunga mbu Ndaleerile omukhasi uno, ne olwa emusitiile ahambi shinyoolile nali nebilolelo biolukhaana ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kho samwana omukhaana nende nyina babukule ebilolelo biolukhaana Iwomukhaana tsana, nibabirusilia abakofu belitaala haluyia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana samwana omukhaana aboolele abakofu ari Ndabashila omusaatsa uno omukhaana wanje, naye amukiyanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khandi lole, amuchiishile amakhuwa ketsisoni, ari Shinyoolile omukhaanawo nali nebilolelo biolukhaana ta. Ne khane ebilolelo biolukhaana Iwomukhaana wanje mbiebino. Mana baale ingubo tsana imbeli wabakofu belitaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abakofu belitaala elo babukule omusaatsa tsana nibamunywekha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibamukhalaka ifwaini tsishekeli eshikhumi tsieifeetsa, nibatsimuheelesia samwana omukhaana, shichila aleereele omukhaana waIsiraeli eliira libii; naye alabeetsanga omukhasiwe; shianyala ekhumwilusia tsindaalo tsiosi tsiobulamubwe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa likhuwa elo niliba liatoto, mbu ebilolelo biolukhaana shiyanyoolwa nali ninabio ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kho barusie omukhaana bamuleere hamuliango weinzu yasamwana, nabo abasaatsa belitaala bamulase namachina afwe; shichila akholile akeshifwabwi muIsiraeli, okhukwa shia omutamba nashili munzu yasamwana; nilwo olwa olarusia obubii obuli hakari weenywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
